	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:357ab39e1734 .
doc:FactsPaperTemporalTwinNet schema1:abstract "This study introduces the TemporalTwinNet (TTN) framework, embedding bidirectional LSTM layers to capture temporal dependencies in time-series data for digital twin-supported fault diagnosis in robotics. Tested on an open-source robotics dataset (3600 simulated, 90 real samples), TTN achieves a real-world test precision of 86.67%, reduces the sim-to-real gap to 9.44%, improves F1 for the healthy state from 0.06 to 0.63, sustains simulation precision of 96.11%, and integrates severity prediction to enhance practical utility for predictive maintenance." .
_:eb2445bc5e3f26c61e41209947026f90 rdf:reifies <<( doc:FactsPaperTemporalTwinNet schema1:abstract "This study introduces the TemporalTwinNet (TTN) framework, embedding bidirectional LSTM layers to capture temporal dependencies in time-series data for digital twin-supported fault diagnosis in robotics. Tested on an open-source robotics dataset (3600 simulated, 90 real samples), TTN achieves a real-world test precision of 86.67%, reduces the sim-to-real gap to 9.44%, improves F1 for the healthy state from 0.06 to 0.63, sustains simulation precision of 96.11%, and integrates severity prediction to enhance practical utility for predictive maintenance." )>> ;
